0345-negroni-apple80211-scan-join: Wi-Fi iOS side: the scan and WPA2-PSK join path for wifid 20H392 complete. Gets 106
RSSI_BOUNDS {1, -90, -40, -80} (layout from IO80211 20H392 Apple80211GetWithIOCTL: RSSI_MIN/MAX/THRESHOLD at +4/+8/+12),
5 POWERSAVE and 18 INT_MIT (value 0), 6 PROTMODE, 14 PHY_MODE (a/b/g), 17 NOISE (-95 dBm), 8 RATE (value: the joined BSS's
best legacy rate); sets 86 SCAN_REQ_MULTIPLE (same passive scan as 10), 5 POWERSAVE, 365 DISPLAY_STATE and 382 ABORT_SCAN
(accepted, nothing to do). Fix: DISASSOCIATE no longer kicks P_LINK_DOWN (new bit P_LEAVE), so a DISASSOCIATE right
before an ASSOCIATE cannot end the new join with the stale error of an older failed join. Request log: at most 6 lines
per kind (a changed result is always said), scans/joins/leaves/power sets always (up to 200); the summary repeats every
600 s while requests come. Type names 96 97 115 267 365 382 383 419 from the IO80211 20H392 name table.
Details: patches/xnu/README-wifi.md "0345".

